OL,3,ANigeria arrests alleged Mexican drug
OL,4,Akingpin at international airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn alleged Mexican drug kingpin was
OL,7,Farrested in Nigeria last month as he
OL,8,Ftried to leave the country, the drug
OL,9,Fenforcement authority has just
OL,10,Frevealed.
OL,12,FThat arrest resulted in the discovery
OL,13,Fof a suspected industrial-scale
OL,14,Fmethamphetamine laboratory - the third
OL,15,Fsuch find allegedly linked to Mexicans
OL,16,Fin four months.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
