OL,3,ANigeria arrests alleged Mexican drug
OL,4,Akingpin at international airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Arturo Carrera Loaiza, 40, was
OL,7,Fdetained at Lagos international
OL,8,Fairport, officials allegedly found
OL,9,Fdigital images of him wearing what they
OL,10,Fbelieved to be a laboratory coat
OL,11,Falongside equipment consistent with
OL,12,Fmeth production.
OL,14,FThe pictures' location data led
OL,15,Fofficers to a property in Ebonyi state,
OL,16,Fwhere they said chemicals and
OL,17,Fdrug-making equipment were found.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
